    </div>

    <!-- Future Scalability Statement -->
    <h2>Future Multi-Tier Roadmap</h2>
    <p>This deployment establishes a continuous infrastructure. Future expansions can directly hook deeper modules (Tier 1-8) including unified omnichannel messaging pipelines, complete digital inspection (DVI) modules, parts management systems, and specialized client mobile apps without rebuilding the system context.</p>

    <!-- Footer Information -->
    <div class="footer-meta">
        <div>Prepared by: <strong>Digital Elevation Co.</strong></div>
        <div>Proposal Validity: <strong>30 Days</strong></div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
